  "properties": {
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Boredom Buster</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header>\n    <h1>Boredom Buster</h1>\n    <p>Not sure what to do? Let us decide for you.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <button id=\"fetchButton\">Give me something to do</button>\n\n    <div class=\"activity-card\">\n      <p class=\"card-label\">TODAY'S ACTIVITY</p>\n      <p id=\"activityText\">Your activity will appear here.</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n  background-color: #F0F7FF;\n  background-image: radial-gradient(#C8DFFB 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);\n  background-size: 28px 28px;\n  color: #1A2E4A;\n  padding: 32px 20px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\nheader {\n  max-width: 480px;\n  margin: 0 auto 28px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nheader h1 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #1A6FD4;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\nheader p {\n  color: #5A7A9A;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\nmain {\n  max-width: 480px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 16px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: white;\n  background-color: #1A6FD4;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 100px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #104FA0;\n  transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background-color: #155BBF;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(3px);\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #104FA0;\n}\n\n.activity-card {\n  background: #FFFFFF;\n  border: 2px dashed #A8C8F0;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.card-label {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  color: #5A7A9A;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n#activityText {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: #1A2E4A;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const btn = document.getElementById(\"fetchButton\");\n\nconst API_URL = \"fake-boredom-buster-url.com\";\n\nconst fetchActivity = async () => {\n  \n  const response = await fetch(API_URL);\n  \n  const data = await response.json();\n\n  // These lines are never reached\n  showActivity(data.activity);\n};\n\nbtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  fetchActivity();\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "// Updates the activity text on the page.\nconst showActivity = (text) => {\n  const activityText = document.getElementById(\"activityText\");\n  activityText.textContent = text;\n};",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Predict & Run\r\n\r\nWe want to test a standard `fetch()` request, but the URL stored in `API_URL` is not working.\r\n\r\n**If the app can't reach the URL in `API_URL`, what do you think will happen? What will the user see on screen?**\r\n\r\nWrite your answer below. Then click the button to test your prediction.\r\n",
